# Logs
# Anchored to the repo root: an unanchored `logs/` also swallowed the
# `app/api/runs/[runId]/logs/` route, and git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded. Build-cache logs live under .next/, ignored separately.
/logs/
*.log

